{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Katie Phar (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that ten-year-old <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katie_Phar\" title=\"Katie Phar\">Katie Phar</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> supported the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Industrial_Workers_of_the_World\" title=\"Industrial Workers of the World\">Industrial Workers of the World</a> during the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spokane_free_speech_fight\" title=\"Spokane free speech fight\">Spokane free speech fight</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katie_Phar","retrieved":1789205489293},{"title":"Mount Hampden (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that around 1,000 graves were exhumed to make way for Zim Cyber City, a development project in <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Hampden\" title=\"Mount Hampden\">Mount Hampden</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Hampden","retrieved":1789205489294},{"title":"Deng Ken (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deng_Ken\" title=\"Deng Ken\">Deng Ken</a></b> placed a newspaper advertisement to find his <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deng_Xiaoping\" title=\"Deng Xiaoping\">elder brother</a>, who initially believed it was a trap set by <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bureau_of_Investigation_and_Statistics\" title=\"Bureau of Investigation and Statistics\">Nationalist Chinese intelligence</a> agents?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deng_Ken","retrieved":1789205489296},{"title":"a building in Boston (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_F._Kennedy_Federal_Building\" title=\"John F. Kennedy Federal Building\">a building in Boston</a></b> was named after slain US president <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_F._Kennedy\" title=\"John F. Kennedy\">John F. Kennedy</a>, after which one writer stated: \"the building mocks the martyred president. It does not memorialize him\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_F._Kennedy_Federal_Building","retrieved":1789205489298},{"title":"Mary of Blois (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that English princess <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_of_Boulogne\" title=\"Marie of Boulogne\">Mary of Blois</a></b> may have colluded in her own abduction from her nunnery by <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matthew_of_Alsace\" title=\"Matthew of Alsace\">Matthew of Alsace</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_of_Boulogne","retrieved":1789205489300},{"title":"Penstemon angelicus (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_Murray_Johnston\" title=\"Ivan Murray Johnston\">Ivan Murray Johnston</a>'s prediction that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penstemon_angelicus\" title=\"Penstemon angelicus\">Penstemon angelicus</a></b></i> would be described as its own species came true more than five decades later?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penstemon_angelicus","retrieved":1789205489302},{"title":"King Ahenzae (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that, according to tradition, <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ahenzae\" title=\"Ahenzae\">King Ahenzae</a></b> lost the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kingdom_of_Benin\" title=\"Kingdom of Benin\">Kingdom of Benin</a>'s royal coral beads to a palace priest through repeated games of dice?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ahenzae","retrieved":1789205489304},{"title":"Bapaume (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Navy\" title=\"French Navy\">French Navy</a> used catapults on their ships after trials with the dispatch ship <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_aviso_Bapaume\" title=\"French aviso Bapaume\">Bapaume</a></b></i> concluded that launching platforms were unsafe?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_aviso_Bapaume","retrieved":1789205489307},{"title":"Jacob F. Wolters (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacob_F._Wolters\" title=\"Jacob F. Wolters\">Jacob F. Wolters</a></b> broke his shoulder by crashing his car into a hog?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacob_F._Wolters","retrieved":1789205489309},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;St. John's&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;BannerStJohns1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Colourful houses and military history await you in Canada's oldest and easternmost city.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-fa